              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naamani akagamba iga, “Hano ökahaancha taimukia ibhing'ënga ibhiköë bhisansabha (6,000) bhia amatiini gi ichimbiria.” Akamögeya, hakurua akamöbhohera amahuntu abhërë na kömöha ichingëbho ibhërë chië ësögökörö, akaha abhakoramërëmo bhaae bhabhërë na köbhateebhia iga bhagenane na Gehasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano bhaahikërë kögëkerege këëra waanyoorë Erisa amenyërë, Gehasi akaimukia amahuntu abhërë gaara gi ichimbiria kurua kö abhakoramërëmo bha Naamani, na akagahira nyumba mooe. Hakurua agatiga abhakoramërëmo bhaara bha Namani bhakaya bhoobho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
